    "needs_human": true,
    "human_action": "Provide the bench power-strip hook and timestamped cut-phase evidence; then run unattended cold cuts.",
    "clause": "REQUIREMENTS.md REQ-VER-06; issue #396 owner/assignment decisions",
    "note": "Each cycle: establish pairs and saved state, snapshot, prove cut phase, remove power, confirm discharge, restore power, observe boot, verify automatic restore, measure reconnect, walk all counters. No next cut before verification finishes. Missing journal instrumentation leaves qualification open.",
    "assert_clauses": {
      "release.complete-evidence": "REQUIREMENTS.md REQ-VER-06; issue #396 owner/assignment decisions: all required assertions need measured PASS records on the exact image; missing, SKIP, INFO, KNOWN-PENDING, NEEDS-HUMAN and INSTRUMENT-SUSPECT cannot qualify a release",
      "power.cold-count-and-phase": "REQUIREMENTS.md REQ-VER-06; issue #396 owner/assignment decisions: 200 confirmed cold cuts, 160 idle and 40 inside a journal commit window; resets never count; preserve cut timestamps and commit-window evidence for each cycle",
      "power.state-restored": "REQUIREMENTS.md REQ-VER-06; issue #396 owner/assignment decisions; Milan v1.2 5.3.5.1, 5.3.7.1/5.3.7.6, 5.3.8.1/5.3.8.2/5.3.8.3/5.3.8.7, 5.3.9.1, 5.3.10.1, 5.3.11.1, 5.3.13; additional state per project inventory: compare each persisted item against the pre-cut snapshot; commit cuts must restore a complete old or new committed snapshot, never mixed state; missing readback cannot pass",
      "power.adp-valid-time": "REQUIREMENTS.md REQ-VER-06; issue #396 owner/assignment decisions; IEEE 1722.1-2021 6.2.2.5, 6.2.4/6.2.5; Milan v1.2 5.6.2/5.6.3: first post-cut ENTITY_AVAILABLE arrives within the advertised valid_time measured from T0, the host-timestamped power-strip ON command; decode the captured pre-cut PDU in two-second units and require valid_time=10 (20 s); power_off_hold_s and pre-cut advertisement age are provenance, not charged to this window; missing capture or a missed deadline fails",
      "power.automatic-restore-bound": "REQUIREMENTS.md REQ-VER-06; issue #396 owner/assignment decisions; Milan v1.2 5.5.1.4 / 5.5.2.6: from T0 to first valid AVTP PDU of EACH persisted binding in both directions, including CRF, must be at most restore_bound_s; provisional 30 s, ratified by the manager using #397 boot-to-entity-enabled and #75 restart measurements; controller repair cannot count",
      "power.rebind-bound": "REQUIREMENTS.md REQ-VER-06; issue #396 owner/assignment decisions; Milan v1.2 5.5.2.4; issue #75: an additional per-cycle controller reconnect after automatic restoration succeeds; CONNECT_RX success to first valid AVTP PDU below 1 second; both restoration and reconnect must pass",
      "power.single-boot": "REQUIREMENTS.md REQ-VER-06; issue #396 owner/assignment decisions; issue #366: complete UART/reset observation from T0 through the next cut or campaign end, at least boot_observation_s, records exactly one BIOS pass and no additional restart; check_release_boot refuses the repeated BIOS pass even if the second pass restores streaming",
      "power.counter-walk": "Milan v1.2 Table 5.4 / Table 5.6; REQ-VER-06: snapshot every declared stream index, both directions and CRF, before and after every cycle; validate masks, supported formats, lock/start-stop invariants and flow"
    },
